# Build context for web/Dockerfile.
#
# node_modules matters most: the image installs its own with `npm ci` in the
# deps stage, and the later `COPY . .` would otherwise overwrite it with the
# host's copy. Next ships platform-specific SWC binaries, so a node_modules
# built on Windows or macOS does not run in the Alpine image -- the build fails,
# or worse, half-works.

node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
coverage/

# Baked into the bundle at build time via the NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL build arg,
# never from a file that happens to be on the machine doing the build.
.env
.env.*

.git/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.tsbuildinfo

# Written by `next dev`, not part of the app.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
